# What an agent's machine wears to use this stack: a model, and nothing about
# where it is served — the fleet file's gateway section says that. `spinloop
# fleet harness` run from the directory holding the fleet file points the agent
# at the gateway; the Spinloop stays valid whatever address the gateway moves to.
#
# The agent holds exactly one credential — the gateway's token, as
# GATEWAY_TOKEN (from the environment, or a .env beside the fleet file). The
# node tokens and engine keys live with the gateway, which presents them to
# the nodes and the engines; none of them ever reach the agent.
PROVIDER llamacpp
MODEL    org/fake-model
ALIAS    fake-model
CONTEXT  4096
